This project uses a four-tier design system.

Components are organized in:
- components/ui/ — pristine shadcn/ui primitives, do not edit
- components/primitives/ — domain-agnostic compositions
- components/features/ — product-level compositions
- components/effects/ — animated/marketing components

Before creating a new component, check if it already exists in the registry.
Use semantic design tokens (--ds-*) instead of hardcoded colors.
Every new component needs an accessibility test with jest-axe.

See src/components/ai-context.md for full system documentation.
